<mujoco model="no_end_effector">
  <!-- The "nothing bolted to the flange" end effector, for fr3_scene.xml.

       fr3.xml attaches whichever model asset the scene names `end_effector`, so a bare arm
       still has to supply one. This is that stub: a single body carrying no geometry and no
       mass, welded to the flange frame.

       It is not dead weight - naming it fr3_link8 materialises franka_description's flange
       link in MuJoCo, which the arm model otherwise stops short of (Menagerie's FR3 ends at
       fr3_link7 plus `attachment_site`). A massless, DOF-less body is legal; MuJoCo's
       mjMINVAL floor only applies to bodies that can move relative to their parent. -->
  <worldbody>
    <body name="fr3_link8"/>
  </worldbody>
</mujoco>
